  "about": {
    "metaTitle": "About the Collectors' Club",
    "metaDescription": "Yebaam's Collectors' Club exists for informational and historical purposes only. We are not for profit.",
    "backToArchive": "← Music Archive",
    "kicker": "About the Club",
    "title": "Collectors' Club",
    "subtitle": "A living archive of 20th-century Latin American music, made by and for collectors.",
    "purposeHeading": "Informational and historical purpose",
    "purposeP1Prefix": "The records, fact sheets, photographs and articles published here exist ",
    "purposeP1Strong": "for informational, educational and historical purposes only",
    "purposeP1Suffix": ". The aim is to preserve and share Latin America's sonic memory among collectors, music lovers, researchers and the curious.",
    "purposeP2Prefix": "This archive ",
    "purposeP2Strong": "is not for profit",
    "purposeP2Suffix": ". Yebaam does not charge to consult, listen to or download Collectors' Club content, and does not monetize this module with ads or subscriptions.",
    "rightsHeading": "Rights and content takedown",
    "rightsP1": "The catalogued records belong to their rights holders. The vast majority are recordings from the 1900s through the 1970s, many in the public domain in their countries of origin or orphan works with an unknown holder. When the holder is known, it is shown on the record.",
    "rightsP2": "If you are the rights holder of a work and would like us to remove it from the archive, contact us and we will remove it without delay.",
    "collabHeading": "How to contribute",
    "collabP1": "If you have a digitization of an old record, a story about a label, or you want to write an article about an artist, you can do it from any thematic club's «Articles» section. Whatever you publish will be automatically linked to the artist and label pages you tag."
  },
